Titanium.Xds — third-party notices
==================================

This assembly vendors a trimmed subset of Protocol Buffer definitions under
`protos/envoy/`. Those definitions are derived from the Apache License 2.0
data-plane API published at:

  https://github.com/envoyproxy/data-plane-api

Reference tag used for the initial subset: v1.32.2 (2024-10).

Protobuf package names, import paths, and type URL prefixes that appear in the
wire protocol are retained for Aggregated Discovery Service (ADS) interop.
Product documentation refers to this feature as Titanium's xDS / ADS client.

